# Detection Rule: Suspicious PowerShell Encoded Command
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 - PowerShell
# Author: Vaibhav Joshi
# Date: 2026-09-23
# Description: Detects PowerShell execution with encoded commands,
#              a common technique to bypass command-line logging.

index=main EncodedCommand | stats count by host | rename host as "Host" | table Host, count
